    'If GTM Preview does not show consent updates, verify Consent Mode v2 is enabled and test in a fresh browser session without existing consent cookie.' => 'Jekk GTM Preview ma jurix l-aġġornamenti tal-kunsens, ivverifika li Consent Mode v2 huwa attivat u ttestja f\'sessjoni ġdida tal-browser mingħajr cookie tal-kunsens eżistenti.',
    'If Polylang or WPML is active, each language can have its own translated policy page. If a translation is missing for some language, the default-language policy page is used as a fallback.' => 'Jekk Polylang jew WPML ikun attiv, kull lingwa jista\' jkollha l-paġna tal-politika tradotta tagħha. Jekk xi lingwa ma jkollhiex traduzzjoni, tintuża minflok il-paġna tal-politika tal-lingwa prinċipali.',
    'If a rule does not apply, prepend .kncc-banner or add !important — your CSS file loads after the plugin\'s, but theme styles can occasionally beat it on specificity.' => 'Jekk regola ma tapplikax, żid .kncc-banner qabilha jew żid !important – il-fajl CSS tiegħek jitgħabba wara dak tal-plugin, iżda l-istili tat-tema xi drabi jistgħu jegħlbuh fl-ispeċifiċità.',
    'If banner typography looks odd with your theme, switch General > Text and font style to Plugin style.' => 'Jekk it-tipografija tal-banner tidher stramba mat-tema tiegħek, issettja Ġenerali > Stil tat-test u tat-tipa fuq Stil tal-plugin.',
    'If the policy page warning shows missing translations, create the translated page in each language and add the [kncc_cookie_policy] shortcode.' => 'Jekk it-twissija tal-paġna tal-politika turi traduzzjonijiet neqsin, oħloq il-paġna tradotta f\'kull lingwa u żid ix-shortcode [kncc_cookie_policy].',
    'If the statistics are empty, make sure visitors have interacted with the banner. Data starts recording after the first consent choice.' => 'Jekk l-istatistika hija vojta, aċċerta ruħek li l-viżitaturi interaġixxew mal-banner. Id-data tibda tiġi rreġistrata wara l-ewwel għażla tal-kunsens.',
    'If tracking still runs before consent, make sure Custom Code blocking is checked on the Script Blocking tab.' => 'Jekk it-traċċar xorta jibda qabel il-kunsens, aċċerta ruħek li Imblukkar tal-kodiċi personalizzat huwa mmarkat fit-tab Imblukkar tal-iscripts.',
    'If unknown cookies are found, an AI helper appears: copy the prompt, paste it into an AI tool, paste the response back into the text box, click Import, then Save Cookies.' => 'Jekk jinstabu cookies mhux magħrufa, jidher assistent tal-IA: ikkopja l-prompt, waħħlu f\'għodda tal-IA, waħħal it-tweġiba lura fil-kaxxa tat-test, ikklikkja Importa, imbagħad Issejvja l-Cookies.',
    'If wp_consent_statistics stays deny after Accept all, clear site cookies or test in a private window, hard-refresh (Ctrl+Shift+R), and confirm the WP Consent API plugin is active.' => 'Jekk wp_consent_statistics jibqa\' deny wara Aċċetta kollox, ħassar il-cookies tas-sit jew ittestja f\'tieqa privata, aġġorna l-paġna kompletament (Ctrl+Shift+R), u kkonferma li l-plugin WP Consent API huwa attiv.',
    'Import' => 'Importa',
    'Individual anonymized consent records for GDPR audit compliance. Records contain a hashed visitor identifier, the consent choice, accepted categories, and the policy version. Records are automatically purged after 13 months.' => 'Rekords individwali u anonimizzati tal-kunsens għall-konformità mal-verifiki tal-GDPR. Ir-rekords fihom identifikatur tal-viżitatur f\'forma ta\' hash, l-għażla tal-kunsens, il-kategoriji aċċettati u l-verżjoni tal-politika. Ir-rekords jitħassru awtomatikament wara 13-il xahar.',
    'Individual consent records for GDPR audit compliance. Records are automatically purged after the retention period (13 months).' => 'Rekords individwali tal-kunsens għall-konformità mal-verifiki tal-GDPR. Ir-rekords jitħassru awtomatikament wara l-perjodu taż-żamma (13-il xahar).',
    'Install Google Site Kit' => 'Installa Google Site Kit',
    'Installation guide' => 'Gwida għall-installazzjoni',
    'Integration' => 'Integrazzjoni',
    'Integration tab' => 'It-tab Integrazzjoni',
    'Intercom: keeps the chat messenger session and visitor identity.' => 'Intercom: iżomm is-sessjoni tal-messenger taċ-chat u l-identità tal-viżitatur.',
    'Invalid JSON format. Please import a valid cookie array.' => 'Format JSON mhux validu. Jekk jogħġbok importa array validu ta\' cookies.',
    'Jetpack Stats: assigns an anonymous identifier used to measure site traffic.' => 'Jetpack Stats: jassenja identifikatur anonimu użat biex jitkejjel it-traffiku tas-sit.',
    'Jetpack Stats: measures site traffic and visitor activity.' => 'Jetpack Stats: ikejjel it-traffiku tas-sit u l-attività tal-viżitaturi.',
    'Jetpack Stats: records referral and navigation data for analytics.' => 'Jetpack Stats: jirreġistra data tar-referenza u tan-navigazzjoni għall-analitika.',
    'Kansleri Cookie Consent is now active. Next steps: %1$s to discover cookies and %2$s to review banner and consent settings.' => 'Kansleri Cookie Consent issa huwa attiv. Il-passi li jmiss: %1$s biex issib il-cookies u %2$s tal-banner u tal-kunsens.',
    'Klaviyo: recognises returning visitors for email marketing.' => 'Klaviyo: jagħraf il-viżitaturi li jerġgħu jiġu għall-marketing bl-email.',
    'Lets visitors re-open cookie settings after they close the banner.' => 'Tħalli lill-viżitaturi jerġgħu jiftħu l-issettjar tal-cookies wara li jagħlqu l-banner.',
    'LinkedIn: browser identifier for ad targeting.' => 'LinkedIn: identifikatur tal-browser għall-immirar tar-reklami.',
    'LinkedIn: browser identifier.' => 'LinkedIn: identifikatur tal-browser.',
    'LinkedIn: data centre selection.' => 'LinkedIn: għażla taċ-ċentru tad-data.',
    'Live preview works with Plugin style only.' => 'Il-previżjoni diretta taħdem biss bl-istil tal-plugin.',
    'Load Google tags before consent, with consent denied' => 'Tella\' t-tags ta\' Google qabel il-kunsens, bil-kunsens miċħud',
    'MailPoet: tracks email subscriber activity.' => 'MailPoet: isegwi l-attività tal-abbonati tal-email.',
    'Marketing' => 'Marketing',
    'Message when no cookies are registered' => 'Messaġġ meta ma jkunu reġistrati l-ebda cookies',
    'Meta Pixel: stores click identifiers.' => 'Meta Pixel: jaħżen l-identifikaturi tal-klikks.',
    'Meta Pixel: tracks visits across websites for ad targeting.' => 'Meta Pixel: isegwi ż-żjarat fuq diversi siti web għall-immirar tar-reklami.',
    'Microsoft Advertising: groups page views into a session for ad measurement.' => 'Microsoft Advertising: jiġbor il-veduti tal-paġni f\'sessjoni għall-kejl tar-reklami.',
    'Microsoft Advertising: identifies the visitor across visits for ad measurement.' => 'Microsoft Advertising: jidentifika l-viżitatur minn żjara għal oħra għall-kejl tar-reklami.',
    'Microsoft Clarity: connects page views into a session.' => 'Microsoft Clarity: jgħaqqad il-veduti tal-paġni f\'sessjoni waħda.',
    'Microsoft Clarity: stores a user ID and preferences.' => 'Microsoft Clarity: jaħżen ID tal-utent u l-preferenzi.',
    'More information' => 'Aktar informazzjoni',
    'Multilingual support' => 'Appoġġ multilingwi',
    'Multilingual support (WPML & Polylang)' => 'Appoġġ multilingwi (WPML & Polylang)',
    'Name' => 'Isem',
    'Necessary' => 'Neċessarji',
    'Necessary (never blocked)' => 'Neċessarji (qatt ma jiġu mblukkati)',
    'Necessary (never blocked) lets an address load right away, even one the plugin would block.' => 'Neċessarji (qatt ma jiġu mblukkati) iħalli indirizz jitgħabba minnufih, anke wieħed li l-plugin kien jimblokka.',
    'Need Google Analytics 4 or Google Tag Manager?' => 'Għandek bżonn Google Analytics 4 jew Google Tag Manager?',
    'Need help describing these cookies?' => 'Għandek bżonn għajnuna biex tiddeskrivi dawn il-cookies?',
    'Need to fine-tune the look beyond the General tab? Add CSS to %s, your child theme, or a Code Snippets plugin.' => 'Trid tirfina d-dehra lil hinn mit-tab Ġenerali? Żid CSS f\'%s, fit-tema child tiegħek jew fi plugin ta\' Code Snippets.',
    'Newest:' => 'L-aktar riċenti:',
    'Next check: %s' => 'Il-verifika li jmiss: %s',
    'No analytics cookies are used on this site.' => 'Dan is-sit ma juża l-ebda cookies analitiċi.',
    'No consent data recorded yet. Statistics will appear after visitors start interacting with the cookie banner.' => 'Għad m\'hemm l-ebda data tal-kunsens irreġistrata. L-istatistika tidher wara li l-viżitaturi jibdew jinteraġixxu mal-banner tal-cookies.',
    'No consent log records yet.' => 'Għad m\'hemm l-ebda rekords fir-reġistru tal-kunsens.',
    'No cookie policy page has been selected. Set a Privacy Policy page in Settings → Privacy, or choose a page below.' => 'Ma ntgħażlet l-ebda paġna tal-politika dwar il-cookies. Issettja paġna tal-Politika tal-Privatezza f\'Issettjar → Privatezza, jew agħżel paġna hawn taħt.',
    'No cookie rows available to export.' => 'M\'hemm l-ebda ringiela ta\' cookies għall-esportazzjoni.',
    'No cookies have been registered yet.' => 'Għadhom ma ġew reġistrati l-ebda cookies.',
    'No cookies registered yet.' => 'Għad m\'hemm l-ebda cookies reġistrati.',
    'No cookies selected.' => 'Ma ntgħażlu l-ebda cookies.',
    'No marketing cookies are used on this site.' => 'Dan is-sit ma juża l-ebda cookies tal-marketing.',
    'No new cookies found.' => 'Ma nstabu l-ebda cookies ġodda.',
    'No preference cookies are used on this site.' => 'Dan is-sit ma juża l-ebda cookies tal-preferenzi.',
    'No valid cookies found in imported JSON.' => 'Ma nstabu l-ebda cookies validi fil-JSON importat.',
    'None of the selected cookies can be removed. Run Scan Cookies again to refresh the list.' => 'L-ebda wieħed mill-cookies magħżula ma jista\' jitneħħa. Erġa\' ħaddem Skennja l-Cookies biex taġġorna l-lista.',
    'Off (default, Basic Consent Mode): the Google tag is blocked until the visitor accepts analytics cookies, and Google Tag Manager until the visitor accepts analytics or marketing cookies, so Google receives nothing from visitors who have not consented.' => 'Mitfi (awtomatiku, Consent Mode bażiku): it-tag ta\' Google huwa mblukkat sakemm il-viżitatur jaċċetta l-cookies analitiċi, u Google Tag Manager sakemm il-viżitatur jaċċetta l-cookies analitiċi jew tal-marketing, għalhekk Google ma jirċievi xejn mill-viżitaturi li ma tawx il-kunsens.',
    'Off by default. When on, the Google tag and Google Tag Manager load before consent instead of being blocked. Until the visitor accepts, they set no cookies and send Google only cookieless pings.' => 'Mitfi b\'mod awtomatiku. Meta jkun mixgħul, it-tag ta\' Google u Google Tag Manager jitgħabbew qabel il-kunsens minflok ma jiġu mblukkati. Sakemm il-viżitatur jaċċetta, ma jissettjaw l-ebda cookies u jibagħtu lil Google biss pings mingħajr cookies.',
    'Oldest:' => 'L-eqdem:',
    'On (Advanced Consent Mode): the Google tag and Google Tag Manager load right away. Until the visitor accepts, they set no cookies and send Google only cookieless pings, which Google uses to model the missing data. Google Analytics and Google Ads expect this mode, and with Basic mode they can report your consent signals as not active.' => 'Mixgħul (Consent Mode avvanzat): it-tag ta\' Google u Google Tag Manager jitgħabbew minnufih. Sakemm il-viżitatur jaċċetta, ma jissettjaw l-ebda cookies u jibagħtu lil Google biss pings mingħajr cookies, li Google juża biex jimmudella d-data nieqsa. Google Analytics u Google Ads jistennew dan il-mod, u bil-mod bażiku jistgħu jirrappurtaw is-sinjali tal-kunsens tiegħek bħala mhux attivi.',
    'Only applies while Consent Mode v2 is enabled. Other tracking scripts on the site stay blocked until consent, also those that Google Tag Manager adds (for example a Meta Pixel or LinkedIn in a Custom HTML tag): each waits for its own category, with no changes needed in the container.' => 'Japplika biss meta Consent Mode v2 ikun attivat. Scripts oħra tat-traċċar fis-sit jibqgħu mblukkati sal-kunsens, anke dawk li jżid Google Tag Manager (pereżempju Meta Pixel jew LinkedIn f\'tag Custom HTML): kull wieħed jistenna l-kategorija tiegħu, mingħajr ma jkun hemm bżonn ta\' bidliet fil-kontenitur.',
    'Open banner preview' => 'Iftaħ il-previżjoni tal-banner',
    'Open the Cookies tab, run Scan Cookies, then review and categorize unknown cookies.' => 'Iftaħ it-tab Cookies, ħaddem Skennja l-Cookies, imbagħad irrevedi u kkategorizza l-cookies mhux magħrufa.',
    'Open the Integration tab and enable Google Consent Mode v2 if you use GTM/Google tags.' => 'Iftaħ it-tab Integrazzjoni u attiva Google Consent Mode v2 jekk tuża GTM jew it-tags ta\' Google.',
    'Or add a link anywhere with the shortcode:' => 'Jew żid link kullimkien bix-shortcode:',
    'Order attribution: keeps traffic-source tracking data compatible across updates.' => 'Attribuzzjoni tal-ordnijiet: iżomm id-data tat-traċċar tas-sors tat-traffiku kompatibbli bejn l-aġġornamenti.',
    'Order attribution: links page views within a visit for attribution.' => 'Attribuzzjoni tal-ordnijiet: jgħaqqad il-veduti tal-paġni fl-istess żjara għall-attribuzzjoni.',
    'Order attribution: records how you first reached the site.' => 'Attribuzzjoni tal-ordnijiet: jirreġistra kif wasalt fis-sit l-ewwel darba.',
    'Order attribution: records how you reached the site on your current visit.' => 'Attribuzzjoni tal-ordnijiet: jirreġistra kif wasalt fis-sit f\'din iż-żjara.',
    'Order attribution: stores the traffic source and campaign of your current visit.' => 'Attribuzzjoni tal-ordnijiet: jaħżen is-sors tat-traffiku u l-kampanja taż-żjara attwali tiegħek.',
    'Order attribution: stores the traffic source and campaign of your first visit.' => 'Attribuzzjoni tal-ordnijiet: jaħżen is-sors tat-traffiku u l-kampanja tal-ewwel żjara tiegħek.',
    'Order attribution: stores visitor/session data used for marketing attribution.' => 'Attribuzzjoni tal-ordnijiet: jaħżen data tal-viżitatur/tas-sessjoni użata għall-attribuzzjoni tal-marketing.',
    'Order attribution: tracks the marketing source of your visit.' => 'Attribuzzjoni tal-ordnijiet: isegwi s-sors tal-marketing taż-żjara tiegħek.',
    'Paste the AI response here:' => 'Waħħal it-tweġiba tal-IA hawn:',
    'Paste the prompt into an AI tool (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, etc.).' => 'Waħħal il-prompt f\'għodda tal-IA (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, eċċ.).',
    'Per-language banner texts' => 'Testi tal-banner għal kull lingwa',
    'Per-language cookie descriptions' => 'Deskrizzjonijiet tal-cookies għal kull lingwa',
    'Per-language settings' => 'Issettjar għal kull lingwa',
    'Permanently deletes all consent log records and aggregate statistics.' => 'Iħassar b\'mod permanenti r-rekords kollha tar-reġistru tal-kunsens u l-istatistika aggregata.',
    'Persists current cookie table values to be used in policy output and consent details.' => 'Jissejvja l-valuri attwali tat-tabella tal-cookies biex jintużaw fil-paġna tal-politika u fid-dettalji tal-kunsens.',
    'Plausible: privacy-friendly analytics.' => 'Plausible: analitika li tirrispetta l-privatezza.',
