    'Remove selected cookies' => 'Neħħi l-cookies magħżula',
    'Remove this cookie?' => 'Tneħħi dan il-cookie?',
    'Renders a link that opens the cookie settings dialog. Use in footers, menus, or widgets. Customize the link text with the text attribute, e.g. [kncc_cookie_settings text="Manage cookies"].' => 'Juri link li jiftaħ it-tieqa tal-issettjar tal-cookies. Użah fil-qiegħ tal-paġna, fil-menus jew fil-widgets. Ippersonalizza t-test tal-link bl-attribut text, eż. [kncc_cookie_settings text="Immaniġġja l-cookies"].',
    'Required for the website to function. Cannot be disabled.' => 'Meħtieġa biex is-sit web jaħdem. Ma jistgħux jiġu diżattivati.',
