    'Scans browser cookies and infers expected cookies from tracking scripts on your site (even when blocked until consent). Known cookies are auto-mapped to categories.' => 'Jiskennja l-cookies tal-browser u jiddeduċi l-cookies mistennija mill-iscripts tat-traċċar fis-sit tiegħek (anke meta jkunu mblukkati sal-kunsens). Il-cookies magħrufa jiġu assenjati awtomatikament għall-kategoriji.',
