    'Secondary button' => 'Buttuna sekondarja',
    'Secondary button text' => 'Test tal-buttuna sekondarja',
    'Segment: stores an anonymous visitor ID and traits.' => 'Segment: jaħżen ID anonimu tal-viżitatur u l-karatteristiċi tiegħu.',
    'Selected cookies removed from the list.' => 'Il-cookies magħżula tneħħew mil-lista.',
    'Selects which page is used for cookie policy content generated by shortcode.' => 'Jagħżel liema paġna tintuża għall-kontenut tal-politika dwar il-cookies iġġenerat mix-shortcode.',
    'Settings' => 'Issettjar',
    'Settings saved.' => 'L-issettjar ġie ssejvjat.',
    'Shortcodes' => 'Shortcodes',
    'Show a small floating button so visitors can re-open their cookie preferences' => 'Uri buttuna żgħira li tgħum biex il-viżitaturi jkunu jistgħu jerġgħu jiftħu l-preferenzi tagħhom dwar il-cookies',
    'Show but lock (disable) the switch' => 'Uri imma sakkar (iddiżattiva) is-swiċċ',
    'Show message' => 'Uri messaġġ',
    'Show message: where the blocked script would show content (reviews, booking, a map), show a message with an accept button instead of an empty gap. Not needed for tracking scripts.' => 'Uri messaġġ: fejn l-iscript imblukkat kien juri kontenut (recensjonijiet, prenotazzjonijiet, mappa), juri messaġġ b\'buttuna għall-aċċettazzjoni minflok spazju vojt. Mhux meħtieġ għall-iscripts tat-traċċar.',
    'Shown when visitors open Customize. Leave a field empty to use the built-in text.' => 'Jintwerew meta l-viżitaturi jiftħu Ippersonalizza. Ħalli qasam vojt biex jintuża t-test integrat.',
    'Shows how many visitors accepted, rejected, or customized cookies over 7, 30, or 90 day periods. Data is aggregated and anonymous — no personal data is stored.' => 'Turi kemm-il viżitatur aċċetta, irrifjuta jew ippersonalizza l-cookies f\'perjodi ta\' 7, 30 jew 90 jum. Id-data hija aggregata u anonima – ma tinħażen l-ebda data personali.',
    'Site Kit sets consent defaults for its own regions. This plugin adds a denied default for all other visitors and sends each visitor\'s choice as a consent update.' => 'Site Kit jissettja l-valuri awtomatiċi tal-kunsens għar-reġjuni tiegħu. Dan il-plugin iżid valur awtomatiku ta\' ċaħda għall-viżitaturi l-oħra kollha u jibgħat l-għażla ta\' kull viżitatur bħala aġġornament tal-kunsens.',
    'Statistics' => 'Statistika',
    'Statistics tab' => 'It-tab Statistika',
    'Stops tracking pasted into Bricks, Elementor, or similar Custom Code fields until the visitor gives consent.' => 'Iwaqqaf it-traċċar imwaħħal f\'Bricks, Elementor jew f\'oqsma simili ta\' kodiċi personalizzat sakemm il-viżitatur jagħti l-kunsens.',
    'Stores your cookie consent preferences.' => 'Jaħżen il-preferenzi tal-kunsens tiegħek għall-cookies.',
    'Table column headings' => 'Titli tal-kolonni tat-tabella',
    'Taboola: identifies the browser for ad targeting.' => 'Taboola: jidentifika l-browser għall-immirar tar-reklami.',
    'Technical note (shown when WP Consent API is active)' => 'Nota teknika (tintwera meta WP Consent API ikun attiv)',
    'Text and font style' => 'Stil tat-test u tat-tipa',
    'Text when no cookies are used' => 'Test meta ma jintużaw l-ebda cookies',
    'Texts of the [kncc_cookie_policy] cookie declaration. Leave a field empty to use the built-in text, which is translated into each language. Category names are edited on the General tab.' => 'Testi tad-dikjarazzjoni tal-cookies [kncc_cookie_policy]. Ħalli qasam vojt biex jintuża t-test integrat, li huwa tradott f\'kull lingwa. L-ismijiet tal-kategoriji jiġu editjati fit-tab Ġenerali.',
    'The AI will return improved JSON with clear cookie descriptions.' => 'L-IA se tagħti lura JSON imtejjeb b\'deskrizzjonijiet ċari tal-cookies.',
    'The Trustmary reviews widget waits for analytics consent, because it stores a visitor ID in the browser. A message with an accept button is shown in its place. To load it right away, add widget.trustmary.com under Block by address with the category “Necessary (never blocked)”.' => 'Il-widget tar-recensjonijiet ta\' Trustmary jistenna l-kunsens għall-analitika, għax jaħżen ID tal-viżitatur fil-browser. Minflokhu jintwera messaġġ b\'buttuna għall-aċċettazzjoni. Biex jitgħabba minnufih, żid widget.trustmary.com taħt Imblokka skont l-indirizz bil-kategorija “Neċessarji (qatt ma jiġu mblukkati)”.',
    'The [kncc_cookie_policy] shortcode shows each category as allowed, denied, or not yet chosen above the Edit cookie preferences button. When WP Consent API is active, a note explains the technical wp_consent_* cookie names used by WordPress plugins.' => 'Ix-shortcode [kncc_cookie_policy] juri kull kategorija bħala permessa, miċħuda jew għadha mhux magħżula, fuq il-buttuna Ibdel il-preferenzi tal-cookies. Meta WP Consent API ikun attiv, nota tispjega l-ismijiet tekniċi tal-cookies wp_consent_* li jużaw il-plugins ta\' WordPress.',
    'The plugin also records anonymous, aggregated consent statistics (how many visitors accepted, rejected, or customized cookies each day) and individual consent log entries for GDPR audit compliance. Consent log entries contain a hashed (non-reversible) visitor identifier, the consent choice, which categories were accepted, and the policy version. No IP addresses, user identifiers, or personal data are stored in plain text. Consent log records are automatically deleted after 13 months.' => 'Il-plugin jirreġistra wkoll statistika anonima u aggregata tal-kunsens (kemm-il viżitatur aċċetta, irrifjuta jew ippersonalizza l-cookies kuljum) u rekords individwali fir-reġistru tal-kunsens għall-konformità mal-verifiki tal-GDPR. Ir-rekords tar-reġistru tal-kunsens fihom identifikatur tal-viżitatur f\'forma ta\' hash (irriversibbli), l-għażla tal-kunsens, liema kategoriji ġew aċċettati u l-verżjoni tal-politika. L-ebda indirizz IP, identifikatur tal-utent jew data personali ma jinħażen bħala test ċar. Ir-rekords tar-reġistru tal-kunsens jitħassru awtomatikament wara 13-il xahar.',
    'The plugin re-checks cookies every day via cron.' => 'Il-plugin jerġa\' jiċċekkja l-cookies kuljum permezz tal-cron.',
    'Theme style (inherit site typography)' => 'Stil tat-tema (jiret it-tipografija tas-sit)',
    'Theme style inherits site typography. Plugin style uses strict sizes/colors for consistent readability.' => 'L-istil tat-tema jiret it-tipografija tas-sit. L-istil tal-plugin juża daqsijiet u kuluri fissi għal qari konsistenti.',
    'Theme style is the default so the policy page matches your site typography. Switch to Plugin style for strict plugin sizes and colors.' => 'L-istil tat-tema huwa l-għażla awtomatika, biex il-paġna tal-politika taqbel mat-tipografija tas-sit tiegħek. Aqleb għall-istil tal-plugin għal daqsijiet u kuluri fissi tal-plugin.',
    'These choices are stored technically as wp_consent_functional, wp_consent_statistics, wp_consent_marketing, and wp_consent_preferences for compatibility with WordPress plugins.' => 'Dawn l-għażliet jinħażnu teknikament bħala wp_consent_functional, wp_consent_statistics, wp_consent_marketing u wp_consent_preferences għall-kompatibbiltà mal-plugins ta\' WordPress.',
    'These cookies allow the website to remember choices you make and provide enhanced functionality and personalisation.' => 'Dawn il-cookies jippermettu lis-sit web jiftakar l-għażliet li tagħmel u jipprovdi funzjonalità mtejba u personalizzazzjoni.',
    'These cookies are essential for the website to function and cannot be switched off.' => 'Dawn il-cookies huma essenzjali biex is-sit web jaħdem u ma jistgħux jintfew.',
    'These cookies are expected from tracking scripts on your site, even when blocked until consent.' => 'Dawn il-cookies huma mistennija mill-iscripts tat-traċċar fis-sit tiegħek, anke meta jkunu mblukkati sal-kunsens.',
    'These cookies are still in your list, but their tracking scripts were not found on the homepage. Review and remove any that are no longer used.' => 'Dawn il-cookies għadhom fil-lista tiegħek, iżda l-iscripts tat-traċċar tagħhom ma nstabux fil-paġna ewlenija. Irrevedihom u neħħi dawk li m\'għadhomx jintużaw.',
    'These cookies are used to deliver relevant advertisements and track ad campaign performance.' => 'Dawn il-cookies jintużaw biex iwasslu reklami rilevanti u jsegwu l-prestazzjoni tal-kampanji tar-reklamar.',
    'These cookies help us understand how visitors interact with the website by collecting and reporting information anonymously.' => 'Dawn il-cookies jgħinuna nifhmu kif il-viżitaturi jinteraġixxu mas-sit web billi jiġbru u jirrapportaw informazzjoni b\'mod anonimu.',
    'This content is blocked because it requires analytics cookies.' => 'Dan il-kontenut huwa mblukkat għax jeħtieġ cookies analitiċi.',
    'This content is blocked because it requires marketing cookies.' => 'Dan il-kontenut huwa mblukkat għax jeħtieġ cookies tal-marketing.',
    'This content is blocked because it requires preference cookies.' => 'Dan il-kontenut huwa mblukkat għax jeħtieġ cookies tal-preferenzi.',
    'This site uses a cookie consent banner powered by Kansleri Cookie Consent. When you interact with the banner, a cookie named <code>kncc_consent</code> is stored in your browser for up to 1 year. It records your consent preferences (which cookie categories you accepted or rejected) so the site can remember your choice on future visits. No personal data is stored in this cookie.' => 'Dan is-sit juża banner tal-kunsens għall-cookies ipprovdut minn Kansleri Cookie Consent. Meta tinteraġixxi mal-banner, cookie bl-isem <code>kncc_consent</code> jinħażen fil-browser tiegħek sa massimu ta\' sena. Dan jirreġistra l-preferenzi tal-kunsens tiegħek (liema kategoriji ta\' cookies aċċettajt jew irrifjutajt) biex is-sit ikun jista\' jiftakar l-għażla tiegħek fiż-żjarat futuri. Ma tinħażen l-ebda data personali f\'dan il-cookie.',
    'This will permanently delete all consent log records and statistics. Continue?' => 'Dan se jħassar b\'mod permanenti r-rekords kollha tar-reġistru tal-kunsens u l-istatistika. Tkompli?',
    'Tips:' => 'Pariri:',
    'Tools like Google Analytics are blocked automatically when added through WordPress plugins (e.g. Google Site Kit).' => 'Għodod bħal Google Analytics jiġu mblukkati awtomatikament meta jiżdiedu permezz ta\' plugins ta\' WordPress (eż. Google Site Kit).',
    'Tooltip and screen reader label of the floating button, and the default text of the [kncc_cookie_settings] link.' => 'Tooltip u tikketta għall-qarrejja tal-iskrin tal-buttuna li tgħum, u t-test awtomatiku tal-link [kncc_cookie_settings].',
    'Total records:' => 'Rekords totali:',
    'Total responses' => 'Tweġibiet totali',
    'Troubleshooting' => 'Soluzzjoni tal-problemi',
    'Trustmary: stores a visitor ID, the landing page and conversions in the browser’s local storage.' => 'Trustmary: jaħżen ID tal-viżitatur, il-paġna tad-dħul u l-konverżjonijiet fil-ħażna lokali tal-browser.',
    'Unknown' => 'Mhux magħrufa',
    'Use the AI prompt on the Policy Page tab to generate the full cookie policy page content. Paste the generated HTML into your policy page.' => 'Uża l-prompt għall-IA fit-tab Paġna tal-politika biex tiġġenera l-kontenut sħiħ tal-paġna tal-politika dwar il-cookies. Waħħal l-HTML iġġenerat fil-paġna tal-politika tiegħek.',
    'Used to deliver relevant advertisements and track campaigns.' => 'Jintużaw biex iwasslu reklami rilevanti u jsegwu l-kampanji.',
    'Version 1.8.10 added cookies for services that are not on your site. They have been removed from the cookie list: %s. If your site does use some of these services, put the cookies back and delete the ones it does not use.' => 'Il-verżjoni 1.8.10 żiedet cookies għal servizzi li mhumiex fuq is-sit tiegħek. Dawn tneħħew mil-lista tal-cookies: %s. Jekk is-sit tiegħek fil-fatt juża xi wħud minn dawn is-servizzi, erġa\' poġġi l-cookies lura u ħassar dawk li ma jużax.',
    'Version 1.8.10 may have added cookies for services that are not on your site: %s. The Google Tag Manager on your site can load any of them, so they were kept. Remove the ones your site does not use.' => 'Il-verżjoni 1.8.10 setgħet żiedet cookies għal servizzi li mhumiex fuq is-sit tiegħek: %s. Google Tag Manager fis-sit tiegħek jista\' jtella\' kwalunkwe wieħed minnhom, għalhekk inżammu. Neħħi dawk li s-sit tiegħek ma jużax.',
    'Video embeds from YouTube and Vimeo are automatically blocked until the visitor accepts marketing cookies. A message with an accept button is shown instead. When the visitor has already consented, videos load normally.' => 'Il-vidjows inkorporati minn YouTube u Vimeo jiġu mblukkati awtomatikament sakemm il-viżitatur jaċċetta l-cookies tal-marketing. Minflokhom jintwera messaġġ b\'buttuna għall-aċċettazzjoni. Meta l-viżitatur ikun diġà ta l-kunsens, il-vidjows jitgħabbew normalment.',
    'Visitor' => 'Viżitatur',
    'WP Consent API sync' => 'Sinkronizzazzjoni mal-WP Consent API',
    'WP Consent API: stores per-service consent overrides used by integrated plugins.' => 'WP Consent API: jaħżen l-eċċezzjonijiet tal-kunsens għal kull servizz li jużaw il-plugins integrati.',
    'WP Consent API: stores your consent choice for analytics cookies. Synced from your consent banner.' => 'WP Consent API: jaħżen l-għażla tal-kunsens tiegħek għall-cookies analitiċi. Sinkronizzat mill-banner tal-kunsens tiegħek.',
    'WP Consent API: stores your consent choice for anonymous statistics. Synced from your consent banner.' => 'WP Consent API: jaħżen l-għażla tal-kunsens tiegħek għall-istatistika anonima. Sinkronizzat mill-banner tal-kunsens tiegħek.',
    'WP Consent API: stores your consent choice for marketing cookies. Synced from your consent banner.' => 'WP Consent API: jaħżen l-għażla tal-kunsens tiegħek għall-cookies tal-marketing. Sinkronizzat mill-banner tal-kunsens tiegħek.',
    'WP Consent API: stores your consent choice for necessary cookies. Synced from your consent banner.' => 'WP Consent API: jaħżen l-għażla tal-kunsens tiegħek għall-cookies neċessarji. Sinkronizzat mill-banner tal-kunsens tiegħek.',
    'WP Consent API: stores your consent choice for preference cookies. Synced from your consent banner.' => 'WP Consent API: jaħżen l-għażla tal-kunsens tiegħek għall-cookies tal-preferenzi. Sinkronizzat mill-banner tal-kunsens tiegħek.',
    'WP Consent API: stores your cookie consent choice. Synced from your consent banner.' => 'WP Consent API: jaħżen l-għażla tal-kunsens tiegħek għall-cookies. Sinkronizzat mill-banner tal-kunsens tiegħek.',
    'We recommend installing Google Site Kit — Google\'s official WordPress plugin. It sets up GA4 and GTM in a few clicks, and works seamlessly with Kansleri Cookie Consent: Consent Mode v2 signals are handled automatically, with no double-loading or conflicts.' => 'Nirrakkomandaw li tinstalla Google Site Kit – il-plugin uffiċjali ta\' Google għal WordPress. Jissettja GA4 u GTM fi ftit klikks, u jaħdem bla xkiel ma\' Kansleri Cookie Consent: is-sinjali ta\' Consent Mode v2 jiġu ġestiti awtomatikament, mingħajr tagħbija doppja jew kunflitti.',
    'We use cookies' => 'Nużaw il-cookies',
    'We use cookies to improve your experience and analyze site traffic. Choose which cookies you allow.' => 'Nużaw il-cookies biex intejbu l-esperjenza tiegħek u nanalizzaw it-traffiku tas-sit. Agħżel liema cookies tippermetti.',
    'What each option means' => 'X\'tfisser kull għażla',
    'When General → Text and font style is set to Plugin style, typography rules use !important. Switch to Theme style for easier overrides.' => 'Meta Ġenerali → Stil tat-test u tat-tipa jkun issettjat fuq Stil tal-plugin, ir-regoli tat-tipografija jużaw !important. Aqleb għal Stil tat-tema biex tibdilhom aktar faċilment.',
    'When WPML or Polylang is active, switch to a secondary language in the admin bar and edit General tab settings (saved per language). With WPML String Translation, you can also translate the [kncc_settings]* admin text strings — those are used when no per-language override is saved. Otherwise each language uses its own plugin defaults (English if unsupported). Texts are never copied blindly from the default language.' => 'Meta WPML jew Polylang ikun attiv, aqleb għal lingwa sekondarja fil-bar tal-amministrazzjoni u editja l-issettjar fit-tab Ġenerali (jiġi ssejvjat għal kull lingwa). B\'WPML String Translation, tista\' wkoll tittraduċi l-istrings tat-test tal-amministrazzjoni [kncc_settings]* – dawn jintużaw meta ma jkun issejvjat l-ebda test speċifiku għal dik il-lingwa. Inkella kull lingwa tuża t-testi awtomatiċi tagħha tal-plugin (bl-Ingliż jekk il-lingwa mhix appoġġjata). It-testi qatt ma jiġu kkupjati bl-addoċċ mil-lingwa prinċipali.',
    'When the WP Consent API plugin is active, Kansleri automatically syncs your banner choices to wp_consent_functional, wp_consent_statistics, wp_consent_marketing, and wp_consent_preferences. This lets consent-aware plugins such as Google Site Kit read the visitor\'s choice. Banner labels (Necessary, Analytics) map to these technical cookie names.' => 'Meta l-plugin WP Consent API ikun attiv, Kansleri awtomatikament jissinkronizza l-għażliet tal-banner ma\' wp_consent_functional, wp_consent_statistics, wp_consent_marketing u wp_consent_preferences. Dan jippermetti lil plugins li jirrispettaw il-kunsens, bħal Google Site Kit, jaqraw l-għażla tal-viżitatur. It-tikketti tal-banner (Neċessarji, Analitika) jikkorrispondu għal dawn l-ismijiet tekniċi tal-cookies.',
    'WooCommerce: stores cart and session data.' => 'WooCommerce: jaħżen id-data tal-karrettun u tas-sessjoni.',
    'WooCommerce: stores customer session.' => 'WooCommerce: jaħżen is-sessjoni tal-klijent.',
    'WordPress: authentication cookie for logged-in users.' => 'WordPress: cookie tal-awtentikazzjoni għall-utenti li daħlu fil-kont.',
    'WordPress: remembers comment author details.' => 'WordPress: jiftakar id-dettalji tal-awtur tal-kummenti.',
    'WordPress: secure authentication cookie.' => 'WordPress: cookie sigur tal-awtentikazzjoni.',
    'WordPress: stores admin personalisation settings.' => 'WordPress: jaħżen l-issettjar tal-personalizzazzjoni tal-amministrazzjoni.',
    'WordPress: stores admin settings timestamp.' => 'WordPress: jaħżen il-marka tal-ħin tal-issettjar tal-amministrazzjoni.',
    'WordPress: stores language preference.' => 'WordPress: jaħżen il-preferenza tal-lingwa.',
    'WordPress: tests if cookies are enabled.' => 'WordPress: jittestja jekk il-cookies humiex attivati.',
    'Yandex Metrica: identifies visitors and stores session settings.' => 'Yandex Metrica: jidentifika l-viżitaturi u jaħżen l-issettjar tas-sessjoni.',
    'You can turn this off on the Script Blocking tab.' => 'Tista\' titfih fit-tab Imblukkar tal-iscripts.',
    'You have not made a choice yet.' => 'Għadek ma għamiltx għażla.',
    'YouTube & Vimeo accept button' => 'Buttuna tal-aċċettazzjoni għal YouTube & Vimeo',
    'YouTube & Vimeo iframe blocking' => 'Imblukkar tal-iframes ta\' YouTube & Vimeo',
    'YouTube & Vimeo message' => 'Messaġġ għal YouTube & Vimeo',
    'Your GTM container identifier (for example GTM-N6828NL). It identifies which tag container your site uses. This field is informational in this plugin and does not inject GTM scripts.' => 'L-identifikatur tal-kontenitur GTM tiegħek (pereżempju GTM-N6828NL). Jidentifika liema kontenitur tat-tags juża s-sit tiegħek. F\'dan il-plugin, dan il-qasam huwa għall-informazzjoni biss u ma jdaħħalx scripts ta\' GTM.',
    'Your current cookie preferences' => 'Il-preferenzi attwali tiegħek dwar il-cookies',
    '[{"name":"_ga","category":"analytics", ...}]' => '[{"name":"_ga","category":"analytics", ...}]',
    'cookie duration1 day' => '1 jum',
    'cookie duration1 minute' => '1 minuta',
    'cookie duration1 year' => '1 sena',
    'cookie duration2 years' => '2 snin',
    'cookie duration24 hours' => '24 siegħa',
    'cookie duration30 days' => '30 jum',
    'cookie duration30 minutes' => '30 minuta',
    'cookie duration6 months' => '6 xhur',
    'cookie duration90 days' => '90 jum',
    'cookie durationPersistent' => 'Persistenti',
    'cookie durationSession' => 'Sessjoni',
    'cookie durationVaries' => 'Ivarja',
    'opens in a new tab' => 'jiftaħ f\'tab ġdida',
    'review settings' => 'irrevedi l-issettjar',
    '— Select a page —' => '— Agħżel paġna —',
    '“%s” is not a usable address. Use at least 4 characters without spaces, for example widget.example.com.' => '“%s” mhuwiex indirizz li jista\' jintuża. Uża mill-inqas 4 karattri mingħajr spazji, pereżempju widget.example.com.',
    '“%s” would block every script on this site. Enter the address of the external service instead.' => '“%s” kien jimblokka kull script f\'dan is-sit. Minflok, daħħal l-indirizz tas-servizz estern.',
  ),
);
